        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Executando o Casdoor no Kubernetes: Helm Chart oficial e Configuração como Código]]></title>
            <link>https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/</link>
            <guid>https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/</guid>
            <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[O Casdoor possui um Helm chart oficial. Ele reside no repositório principal em manifests/casdoor, é publicado a cada lançamento do Casdoor no GHCR e está listado no Artifact Hub. Começando com o Casdoor v4.18.0, o chart também pode manter suas organizações, aplicações, usuários e provedores como configuração declarativa: altere-os no arquivo values, execute helm upgrade, e os pods em execução aplicam a mudança sem reiniciar.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>O Casdoor possui um Helm chart oficial. Ele reside no repositório principal em <a href="https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/tree/master/manifests/casdoor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class=""><code>manifests/casdoor</code></a>, é publicado a cada lançamento do Casdoor no GHCR e está listado no <a href="https://artifacthub.io/packages/helm/casdoor/casdoor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Artifact Hub</a>. Começando com o Casdoor v4.18.0, o chart também pode manter suas organizações, aplicações, usuários e provedores como configuração declarativa: altere-os no arquivo values, execute <code>helm upgrade</code>, e os pods em execução aplicam a mudança sem reiniciar.</p>
<p>Este post percorre uma implantação no Kubernetes desde o primeiro <code>helm install</code> até uma configuração que você pode manter no Git.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="install">Instalar<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#install" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Instalar" title="Link direto para Instalar" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>Você precisa do Helm v3.8+ e de um cluster:</p>
<div class="language-shell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-shell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">helm install casdoor oci://ghcr.io/casdoor/helm-charts/casdoor</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>A versão do chart é a versão do Casdoor, então <code>--version 4.18.0</code> instala o Casdoor 4.18.0. Sem um Ingress ou Gateway, o serviço só é acessível dentro do cluster. Para testá-lo, encaminhe uma porta:</p>
<div class="language-shell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-shell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">kubectl port-forward svc/casdoor 8000:8000</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Depois abra <code>http://localhost:8000</code>. Na primeira visita, o Casdoor pede para definir a senha de <code>built-in/admin</code>; então faça login com ela. Veja <a class="" href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/docs/basic/server-installation/#sign-in">Entrar no console administrativo</a>.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="a-production-setup">Uma configuração de produção<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#a-production-setup" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Uma configuração de produção" title="Link direto para Uma configuração de produção" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>Os padrões são destinados a um teste rápido: o Casdoor armazena seus dados em SQLite dentro do contêiner, portanto eles são perdidos quando o pod é substituído. Para uma implantação real, coloque as configurações abaixo em um arquivo <code>values.yaml</code> e instale com <code>helm install casdoor oci://ghcr.io/casdoor/helm-charts/casdoor -f values.yaml</code>.</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="external-database">Banco de dados externo<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#external-database" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Banco de dados externo" title="Link direto para Banco de dados externo" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<div class="language-yaml codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token key atrule">database</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">driver</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> postgres </span><span class="token comment" style="color:rgb(98, 114, 164)"># or mysql, cockroachdb</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">host</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> postgres.db.svc.cluster.local</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">user</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> casdoor</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">password</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> change</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">me</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">databaseName</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> casdoor</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">sslMode</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> require</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Para manter a senha do banco de dados fora do arquivo values, coloque todo o <code>app.conf</code> em um Secret e defina <code>configFromSecret</code> com o nome dele.</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="exposing-casdoor">Expondo o Casdoor<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#exposing-casdoor" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Expondo o Casdoor" title="Link direto para Expondo o Casdoor" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>O chart suporta tanto um Ingress clássico quanto a API Gateway. Com um controlador Ingress e cert-manager:</p>
<div class="language-yaml codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token key atrule">ingress</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">enabled</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token boolean important">true</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">className</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> nginx</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">annotations</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token key atrule">cert-manager.io/cluster-issuer</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> letsencrypt</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">prod</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">hosts</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">host</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> door.example.com</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token key atrule">paths</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">path</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> /</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">          </span><span class="token key atrule">pathType</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> Prefix</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">tls</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">secretName</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> casdoor</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">tls</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token key atrule">hosts</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> door.example.com</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Com a API Gateway (Istio, Envoy Gateway, Cilium, Kong, NGINX Gateway Fabric e outros), anexe um <code>HTTPRoute</code> a um Gateway existente:</p>
<div class="language-yaml codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token key atrule">gatewayApi</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">enabled</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token boolean important">true</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">parentRefs</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> my</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">gateway</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token key atrule">namespace</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> gateway</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">system</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">hostnames</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> door.example.com</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>O chart também pode criar o Gateway ele mesmo e adicionar um redirecionamento de HTTP para HTTPS, veja o <a class="" href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/docs/basic/try-with-helm/#exposing-casdoor">guia do Helm</a>.</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="more-than-one-replica">Mais de uma réplica<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#more-than-one-replica" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Mais de uma réplica" title="Link direto para Mais de uma réplica" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>Por padrão, o Casdoor mantém sessões de login no disco local. Antes de executar mais de uma réplica, aponte todas elas para o mesmo Redis, para que um usuário permaneça autenticado independentemente do pod que atender à solicitação. Cada configuração do <code>app.conf</code> pode ser passada como uma variável de ambiente, então o endpoint pode vir de um Secret:</p>
<div class="language-yaml codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token key atrule">replicaCount</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token number">3</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token key atrule">envFromSecret</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> redisEndpoint</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token key atrule">secretName</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> casdoor</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">redis</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token key atrule">key</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> endpoint </span><span class="token comment" style="color:rgb(98, 114, 164)"># host:port, or host:port,db,password</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>O mesmo Redis é usado para o estado do fluxo de dispositivo OAuth. Uma vez que o Redis esteja configurado, <code>autoscaling.enabled: true</code> adiciona um HorizontalPodAutoscaler.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="configuration-as-code">Configuração como código<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#configuration-as-code" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Configuração como código" title="Link direto para Configuração como código" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>Clicar em organizações e aplicações juntos na interface web é bom para um primeiro teste, mas a maioria das equipes deseja que a configuração de seu provedor de identidade seja revisada e versionada como o resto de sua infraestrutura. Os valores <code>initData</code> fazem isso:</p>
<div class="language-yaml codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token key atrule">initData</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">enabled</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token boolean important">true</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">data</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token key atrule">organizations</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">owner</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> admin</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> acme</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">displayName</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> Acme</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">passwordType</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> bcrypt</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token key atrule">applications</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">owner</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> admin</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> app</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">acme</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">portal</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">organization</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> acme</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">displayName</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> Acme Portal</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">redirectUris</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">          </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> https</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain">//portal.acme.example.com/callback</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token key atrule">users</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">owner</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> acme</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> alice</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">displayName</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> Alice</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">password</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> change</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">me</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">signupApplication</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> app</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">acme</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">portal</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token key atrule">roles</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token key atrule">owner</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> acme</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">name</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> admins</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">displayName</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> Admins</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">users</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">[</span><span class="token plain">acme/alice</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">]</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">        </span><span class="token key atrule">isEnabled</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token boolean important">true</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>O chart armazena os dados em um Secret e monta-o nos pods. O Casdoor aplica-os na inicialização, depois verifica-os a cada 30 segundos (<code>initData.watchInterval</code>). Quando você altera os dados e executa <code>helm upgrade</code>, o kubelet atualiza o Secret montado e os pods em execução aplicam-no sem reiniciar.</p>
<p>Algumas regras tornam isso seguro de usar junto com a interface web:</p>
<ul>
<li class=""><strong>Somente os campos que você escreve são gerenciados.</strong> Um objeto que já existe recebe os campos definidos no arquivo; seus outros campos mantêm os valores editados na interface. Você pode gerenciar apenas os URIs de redirecionamento de uma aplicação e deixar o resto para o console administrativo.</li>
<li class=""><strong>Passwords are initial passwords.</strong> A user's <code>password</code> is only used when the user is created, so users can change theirs afterwards.</li>
<li class=""><strong>Nothing is deleted.</strong> Removing an object from the file doesn't remove it from Casdoor.</li>
<li class=""><strong>Errors don't take Casdoor down.</strong> If an object fails to apply, the error is logged and Casdoor keeps serving; the data is retried on every check until it applies.</li>
</ul>
<p>The file format is the one Casdoor has always used for <a class="" href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/docs/deployment/data-initialization/">data initialization</a>: organizations, applications, users, providers, certs, roles, permissions, groups, LDAP servers, webhooks, plans, pricings and more, with the same field names as the REST API. A quick way to get started is to export an existing instance with <code>casdoor -export</code> and keep the objects you want to manage.</p>
<p>To keep the data out of the values file, for example when it is managed by Sealed Secrets or External Secrets, create the Secret yourself:</p>
<div class="language-yaml codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-yaml codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token key atrule">initData</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">enabled</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token boolean important">true</span><span class="token plain"></span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">existingSecret</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> casdoor</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">init</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">-</span><span class="token plain">data</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token key atrule">existingSecretKey</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color:rgb(248, 248, 242)">:</span><span class="token plain"> init_data.yaml</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>The same feature works without Kubernetes. Mount a JSON or YAML file and set:</p>
<div class="language-ini codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-ini codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">initDataFile = /init-data/init_data.yaml</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">initDataMerge = true</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">initDataWatchInterval = 30</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="or-use-terraform">Or use Terraform<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#or-use-terraform" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Or use Terraform" title="Link direto para Or use Terraform" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>If you prefer <code>terraform plan</code>, imports of existing objects and drift detection, the official <a href="https://registry.terraform.io/providers/casdoor/casdoor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Terraform provider</a> manages the same objects through the Casdoor API:</p>
<div class="language-terraform codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-terraform codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">resource "casdoor_application" "portal" {</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  name          = "app-acme-portal"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  organization  = "acme"</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">  redirect_uris = ["https://portal.acme.example.com/callback"]</span><br></span><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">}</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Use the Helm values when the configuration should ship with the deployment, and Terraform when Casdoor is one of many systems you already manage with it. See the <a class="" href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/docs/deployment/terraform/">Terraform guide</a>.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="coming-from-the-old-chart">Coming from the old chart<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#coming-from-the-old-chart" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Coming from the old chart" title="Link direto para Coming from the old chart" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>Up to v4.15.0, the chart was published as <code>oci://registry-1.docker.io/casbin/casdoor-helm-charts</code>, and the separate <code>casdoor/casdoor-helm</code> repository is now archived. The Docker Hub chart still receives every release, but new installs should use the GHCR one. Moving an existing release over is a regular upgrade, and resource names stay the same:</p>
<div class="language-shell codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#F8F8F2;--prism-background-color:#282A36"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-shell codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#F8F8F2;background-color:#282A36"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#F8F8F2"><span class="token plain">helm upgrade casdoor oci://ghcr.io/casdoor/helm-charts/casdoor --version &lt;version&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="links">Ligações<a href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/blog/casdoor-on-kubernetes/#links" class="hash-link" aria-label="Link direto para Liga�ções" title="Link direto para Ligações" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li class="">Helm chart: <a href="https://artifacthub.io/packages/helm/casdoor/casdoor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Artifact Hub</a> · <a href="https://github.com/casdoor/casdoor/tree/master/manifests/casdoor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">source</a></li>
<li class="">Guides: <a class="" href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/docs/basic/try-with-helm/">Try with Helm</a> · <a class="" href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/docs/deployment/data-initialization/#configuration-as-code">Data initialization and configuration as code</a> · <a class="" href="https://casdoor.ai/pt/docs/deployment/terraform/">Terraform</a></li>
<li class="">Don't want to run it yourself? <a href="https://www.casdoor.com/pricing?utm_source=casdoor.ai&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_content=kubernetes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">Casdoor Cloud</a> gives you a dedicated Casdoor instance that we host and keep upgraded for you.</li>
</ul>]]></content:encoded>
